{
  "name": "dsh-access-phone-remote",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "在手机上跟你电脑里的 AI 对话，顺便遥控这台电脑：推送 / 传文件 / 位置 / 自定义动作。数据全留在你自己电脑上。 · Chat with the AI on your own PC from your phone, plus push, file transfer and location. Everything stays local.",
